~ meetingGnomeKing
[color=grey]Gnome King[/color]: [speed=0.3] And what have you brought me this time, Shmebulock? Another snack?
[color=grey]Shmebulock[/color]: [speed=0.3] Something like that. I wouldn't be opposed to seeing you eat such insolence.
[color=grey]Zed[/color]: [speed=0.3] Hold on! Wait! I can be a friend! Don't eat me I taste like sadness and financial troubles!
[color=grey]Gnome King[/color]: [speed=0.3] Hmm... I could use another errand boy to do my tasks...
[color=grey]Gnome King[/color]: [speed=0.3] Tell you what, kid, I have a few tasks I really should be doing,
[color=grey]Gnome King[/color]: [speed=0.3] but since you showed up, perfect time to delegate them!
[color=grey]Gnome King[/color]: [speed=0.3] I hear that the mushroom farmer Bloogargth needed my help for something, I'm unsure what...
[color=grey]Gnome King[/color]: [speed=0.3] Come back to me after you've helped him out!
[color=grey]Zed[/color]: [speed=0.3] Alright!



