[color=grey]Zed[/color]: [speed=0.3] Come on, I can at least try! What do you need help with?
[color=grey]Bloogargth[/color]: [speed=0.3] So... I might've gotten my Food mushrooms mixed up with my Fun mushrooms...
[color=grey]Bloogargth[/color]: [speed=0.3] And I need help finding the Food ones, I'm starving...
[color=grey]Zed[/color]: [speed=0.3] sigh... I really don't have any other choice, do I?
